---
import Root from '../layouts/Root.astro';
---

<Root title="About" description="Uncovering truth in the spirit of unity.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-mist mb-8">About</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-mist max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg text-mist/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Mistyk Media is an investigative, public blog-site that dares to look deeper and challenge the status quo.
      </p>

      <p class="text-mist/60 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        This space is built around <strong class="text-mist/80">The Dispatch</strong> — investigative writing on power, narrative, and the systems that shape both. Alongside it lives <strong class="text-mist/80">The Inner Journey</strong>, a smaller thread of writing on consciousness and esotericism, and a <a href="/links" class="text-coral hover:underline">Links</a> page pointing to the music and software I make outside of writing.
      </p>

      <p class="text-mist/60 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        The name <em>mistyk</em> carries no affiliation with organized mysticism. It marks a disposition: toward the hidden, the interconnected, the questions that resist easy answers. Toward unity without uniformity. Toward truth without dogma.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-8 border-coral/10" />

      <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-mist mb-4">Connect</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-mist/60">
        <li>
          <a href="/links" class="text-coral hover:text-coral/80 transition-colors">
            Links — Music & Development
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/M1ztick" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-coral hover:text-coral/80 transition-colors">
            GitHub
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="mailto:m1styk@ikmail.com" class="text-coral hover:text-coral/80 transition-colors">
            m1styk@ikmail.com
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Root>
